ew":"No Review","search":{"DAF":["Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["au-8cd112e1-9057-4f9f-986c-383920d40559"],"src":["AU Aarhus University"],"title":"The molecular mechanism for overcoming the ratelimiting step in monoamine neurotransmitter transport","type":"Conference Poster","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-209641","year":"2016","yearsub":"2016"}
{"abstract":"Bacterial members of the neurotransmitter:sodium symporter (NSS) family perform Na +-dependent amino-acid uptake and extrude H + in return. Previous NSS structures represent intermediates of Na +/substrate binding or intracellular release, but not the inward-to-outward return transition. Here we report crystal structures of Aquifex aeolicus LeuT in an outward-oriented, Na +- and substrate-free state likely to be H +-occluded. We find a remarkable rotation of the conserved Leu25 into the empty substrate-binding pocket and rearrangements of the empty Na + sites. Mutational studies of the equivalent Leu99 in the human serotonin transporter show a critical role of this residue on the transport rate. Molecular dynamics simulations show that extracellular Na + is blocked unless Leu25 is rotated out of the substrate-binding pocket. We propose that Leu25 facilitates the inward-to-outward transition by compensating a Na +- and substrate-free state and acts as the gatekeeper for Na + binding that prevents leak in inward-outward return transitions.","author_count":12,"contributors":["Malinauskaite, Lina","Said, Saida","Sahin, Caglanur","Grouleff, Julie","Shahsavar, Azadeh","Bjerregaard, Henriette","Noer, Pernille Rimmer","Severinsen, Kasper","Boesen, Thomas","Schiøtt, Birgit","Sinning, Steffen","Nissen, Poul"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-234334"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"a conserved leucine occupies the empty substrate site of leut in the na free return state","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"Ikke-specificeret","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1038/ncomms11673","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-234334","identifier":[{"id":"27221344","type":"pmid"},{"id":"PMC4894957","type":"pmcid"},{"id":"84987813686","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["au-b801e849-43fb-4b9a-b6cf-04c0ccc80718"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-192032AB4F462DAEFBC3F12CFD14E079"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://www.nature.com/ncomms/2016/160525/ncomms11673/full/ncomms11673.html","version":"Other Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"Ikke-specificeret","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1038/ncomms11673","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"Ikke-specificeret","type":"loc","url":"https://pure.au.dk/ws/files/100299518/ncomms11673_2_.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2016","yearSub":"2016"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Natural Sciences, Department of Molecular Biology and Genetics, Department of Molecular Biology and Genetics - Neurobiology"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Lina","key":"malinauskaitepau","last":"Malinauskaite","locid":"ffb5cd02-ff33-44b5-842d-c8c240e05620","name":"Malinauskaite, Lina","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Saida","key":"saidpau","last":"Said","locid":"f0438b77-b29c-4c02-8de3-5d548680f273","name":"Said, Saida","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Caglanur","key":"sahinpau","last":"Sahin","locid":"2b9a6c91-5606-40b7-a800-85ec59cd27cd","name":"Sahin, Caglanur","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Julie","key":"grouleffpau","last":"Grouleff","locid":"809cd548-e9aa-4c73-94e9-ed20d838d344","name":"Grouleff, Julie","rank":4,"rolecode":